      "title": {
        "en": "Practical Demonstration: FOMO",
        "zh": "实践展示：通过预设入场与禁止交易规则防止错失恐惧"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate preventing fomo with predefined entry and no-trade rules. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示通过预设入场与禁止交易规则防止错失恐惧。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
      },
